### 3. Currency Subsystem Methods

**File:** `C:\UEProjects\WjWorld\Source\WjWorld\Currency\WjWorldCurrencySubsystem.h`

**Core Gem Pack Purchase Method:**
```cpp
/** Steam 결제로 유료 재화 팩 구매 */
